    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHAM! Punch enemies to the building and destroy it !</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300aWhamPunch\u300b is a first-person superpowered combat game that focuses on high-speed battles, environmental destruction, and uniquely designed levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAME FEATURE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408440/extras/feature.png?t=1743945633\" /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight using your fists\u2014charge up your punches to send enemies flying with shockwaves and air pressure, creating exaggerated knockback effects. Smash them into buildings, causing massive explosions and large-scale environmental destruction.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Almost all enemies and NPCs can be punched into the air, and most buildings in the world can be destroyed\u2014from streetlights and water towers to even skyscrapers and mountains.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408440/extras/a74f9759558d2cf1b8a4567f1c5b1107.poster.avif?t=1743945633\" width=800 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408440/extras/a74f9759558d2cf1b8a4567f1c5b1107.webm?t=1743945633\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408440/extras/a74f9759558d2cf1b8a4567f1c5b1107.mp4?t=1743945633\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SUPERPOWER BATTLE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408440/extras/e54a490afdc9f3bbf7cac211ade13e5d.avif?t=1743945633\" data-has-big width=800 height=153 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat enemies to gain new abilities and unlock different combat styles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can acquire three distinct superpowers: <strong>Force, Lightning, and Fire</strong>.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Force</strong> enables powerful melee combos with devastating impact.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lightning</strong> summons thunderbolts to weaken enemy resilience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fire</strong> unleashes explosive attacks to break enemy shields.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408440/extras/720fa33ddf2c4a32845d77187b230a2f.poster.avif?t=1743945633\" width=594 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408440/extras/720fa33ddf2c4a32845d77187b230a2f.webm?t=1743945633\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408440/extras/720fa33ddf2c4a32845d77187b230a2f.mp4?t=1743945633\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SUPERPOWER ENEMIES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408440/extras/b774a2b5ba9bb45dcebaae5fe870c451.avif?t=1743945633\" data-has-big width=800 height=153 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in brutal combat against different types of superpowered foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features around <strong>10 unique boss fights</strong> and elite enemies, each possessing their own special abilities.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some are as fast as lightning, making them hard to hit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some command thunder, summoning devastating strikes at will.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some possess immense physical strength and can send the player flying.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some are enhanced by technology, wielding advanced firearms and energy weapons.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To succeed, players must <strong>adapt their strategies</strong> and <strong>make the most of their superpowers to counter each enemy\u2019s abilities.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408440/extras/b1a4c4b22bfafbf540f93fda6f0faf99.poster.avif?t=1743945633\" width=594 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408440/extras/b1a4c4b22bfafbf540f93fda6f0faf99.webm?t=1743945633\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408440/extras/b1a4c4b22bfafbf540f93fda6f0faf99.mp4?t=1743945633\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WORLDS &amp; LEVELS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408440/extras/5710daff7790f28b0f3ece7b9bfe8036.avif?t=1743945633\" data-has-big width=800 height=153 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your powers to defeat enemies or complete challenges, then enter a portal to progress to the next level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore <strong>diverse, linear levels</strong>\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From towering <strong>cyberpunk neon cities</strong> to <strong>decaying post-apocalyptic ruins</strong>. Leap between <strong>floating islands inspired by Eastern mythology</strong>, or use your abilities to launch yourself like a rocket, navigating through <strong>satellite cities in the upper atmosphere</strong>. Master your powers to reach and explore every corner of each level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408440/extras/ae7d38b6b5d05c5727a55dbaadd29a10.avif?t=1743945633\" data-has-big width=800 height=754 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300aWhamPunch\u300bis a <strong>solo-developed indie game</strong>, aiming to create a brand-new <strong>first-person superpowered combat experience</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019d love to hear your feedback and support through <strong>Discord, X (Twitter), or other social media</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thank you!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHAM! Punch enemies to the building and destroy it !</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300aWhamPunch\u300b is a first-person superpowered combat game that focuses on high-speed battles, environmental destruction, and uniquely designed levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAME FEATURE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408440/extras/feature.png?t=1743945633\" /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight using your fists\u2014charge up your punches to send enemies flying with shockwaves and air pressure, creating exaggerated knockback effects. Smash them into buildings, causing massive explosions and large-scale environmental destruction.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Almost all enemies and NPCs can be punched into the air, and most buildings in the world can be destroyed\u2014from streetlights and water towers to even skyscrapers and mountains.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408440/extras/a74f9759558d2cf1b8a4567f1c5b1107.poster.avif?t=1743945633\" width=800 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408440/extras/a74f9759558d2cf1b8a4567f1c5b1107.webm?t=1743945633\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408440/extras/a74f9759558d2cf1b8a4567f1c5b1107.mp4?t=1743945633\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SUPERPOWER BATTLE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408440/extras/e54a490afdc9f3bbf7cac211ade13e5d.avif?t=1743945633\" data-has-big width=800 height=153 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat enemies to gain new abilities and unlock different combat styles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can acquire three distinct superpowers: <strong>Force, Lightning, and Fire</strong>.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Force</strong> enables powerful melee combos with devastating impact.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lightning</strong> summons thunderbolts to weaken enemy resilience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fire</strong> unleashes explosive attacks to break enemy shields.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408440/extras/720fa33ddf2c4a32845d77187b230a2f.poster.avif?t=1743945633\" width=594 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408440/extras/720fa33ddf2c4a32845d77187b230a2f.webm?t=1743945633\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408440/extras/720fa33ddf2c4a32845d77187b230a2f.mp4?t=1743945633\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SUPERPOWER ENEMIES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408440/extras/b774a2b5ba9bb45dcebaae5fe870c451.avif?t=1743945633\" data-has-big width=800 height=153 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in brutal combat against different types of superpowered foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features around <strong>10 unique boss fights</strong> and elite enemies, each possessing their own special abilities.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some are as fast as lightning, making them hard to hit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some command thunder, summoning devastating strikes at will.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some possess immense physical strength and can send the player flying.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some are enhanced by technology, wielding advanced firearms and energy weapons.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To succeed, players must <strong>adapt their strategies</strong> and <strong>make the most of their superpowers to counter each enemy\u2019s abilities.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408440/extras/b1a4c4b22bfafbf540f93fda6f0faf99.poster.avif?t=1743945633\" width=594 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408440/extras/b1a4c4b22bfafbf540f93fda6f0faf99.webm?t=1743945633\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408440/extras/b1a4c4b22bfafbf540f93fda6f0faf99.mp4?t=1743945633\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WORLDS &amp; LEVELS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408440/extras/5710daff7790f28b0f3ece7b9bfe8036.avif?t=1743945633\" data-has-big width=800 height=153 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your powers to defeat enemies or complete challenges, then enter a portal to progress to the next level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore <strong>diverse, linear levels</strong>\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From towering <strong>cyberpunk neon cities</strong> to <strong>decaying post-apocalyptic ruins</strong>. Leap between <strong>floating islands inspired by Eastern mythology</strong>, or use your abilities to launch yourself like a rocket, navigating through <strong>satellite cities in the upper atmosphere</strong>. Master your powers to reach and explore every corner of each level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408440/extras/ae7d38b6b5d05c5727a55dbaadd29a10.avif?t=1743945633\" data-has-big width=800 height=754 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300aWhamPunch\u300bis a <strong>solo-developed indie game</strong>, aiming to create a brand-new <strong>first-person superpowered combat experience</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019d love to hear your feedback and support through <strong>Discord, X (Twitter), or other social media</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thank you!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
